        "mods": {
          "max": 6,
          "current": 0,
          "list": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The default profile is for a laser pistol. A laser gun can accept one each of the following mods. Any Stock mods change the weapon to a laser rifle.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><strong>Capacitor:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.YzxrJtOzjOnCH8ru]{Photon Exciter}</span>, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WmZ06bzwzSsmRhHh]{Beta Wave Tuner}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.9wWBjcAJvxzgAa9c]{Boosted Capacitor}<span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aqD7umOFLASYslWg]{Photon Agitator}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Barrel:</span></strong> <span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6py6TtlkeywhWQl1]{Long Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.fN4Om6m8QwAkLgVS]{Automatic Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.flcN9XQYhiI62TtL]{Sniper Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.yRV0OZKqZpjBZ0eJ]{Improved Barrel}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Grip: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.oFXs4w5msufzhIVI]{Sharpshooter's Grip}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Stock:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.Xiya2cq2V9TZ0UFC]{Standard Stock}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.GcvxfPv8mm8bpxM7]{Marksman's Stock}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.esTu2kHbvyxBdSFV]{Recoil Compensating Stock}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Sights:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WZAnlfreDNUAaX4Y]{Reflex Sight}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.9IW2T8sgBoIzzxn8]{Short Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.0mBcFGCDPdhVRPsP]{Long Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aQLTpQYLnuRen9xP]{Short Night Vision Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium